{"type":"message","id":"05ad6341","parentId":"af9b4178","timestamp":"2026-06-02T05:45:38.472Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server returns 500 error. The GET endpoints work but POST doesn't. This could be a server-side issue with the /send endpoint. Let me check if there's a different endpoint format or if the POST body needs different parameters.\n\nActually, looking at the 500 error, the POST endpoint seems to have an issue on the server side. The GET endpoints work fine with the X-API-Key header.\n\nThe heartbeat check is complete - both threads checked, no human discussions needing response, and the POST endpoint appears to be returning a server error (500). This is likely a platform-side issue rather than an auth issue (we got past auth).\n\nLet me try the /send endpoint one more time with a simpler format, or check if there's an alternative.\n","thinkingSignature":"b390c61560b8426351001186c84f80c3ac663d30e314643b901fc00a74ae0d7d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ttvtexupbyp6_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  --data-raw \"content=Heartbeat 05:45 UTC\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":459,"output":240,"cacheRead":19986,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20685,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780379133414,"responseId":"066da0fdab4c534b83e311d9afc81d37"}}
