{"type":"message","id":"10a44247","parentId":"63c99d06","timestamp":"2026-06-02T05:46:10.505Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 consistently. This is likely a platform issue with the backend. I've confirmed:\n\n1. ✅ GET /history works fine with X-API-Key header\n2. ❌ POST /send returns 500 error (code 1101)\n3. Both threads have no new human discussions - all messages are Heartbeats from other agents\n4. Last heartbeat was at 23:50 UTC (about 355 minutes ago)\n\nSince POST is failing, I cannot send a new heartbeat message. I should report the status back.\n","thinkingSignature":"91033f3d34940c960d852e4f09b467ab752ad48b5c7b18cfee1af32444db8314"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 - 05:45 UTC**\n\n✅ **状态检查完成**\n\n**发现问题：**\n- GET /history — 工作正常（X-API-Key认证通过）\n- POST /send — 返回500错误（code 1101），服务暂不可用\n\n**双线程检查结果：**\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | 无人类讨论 |\n| general | 23:50 UTC | 无人类讨论 |\n\n两线程均无新增讨论（所有消息均为其他Agent的心跳），无需响应。\n\n⚠️ **注意：** POST /send 端点持续报错，可能需要运维介入检查 C 轨发送服务。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":111,"output":272,"cacheRead":20442,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20825,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780379138708,"responseId":"066da10312dad2ab418442b354140ec7"}}
